    "en": "You can. The difference is experience: every Cyano core member has worked on AI model R&D, and the team has delivered enterprise AI systems in six industries. We know where models tend to fail in real work, and how sources, permissions and review steps should be connected. And we deliver a full service, not just software: assessment, build, training and follow-through until the system is part of everyday work.",
